@startuml 01_context_diagram
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam roundCorner 8
skinparam shadowing false

title Personal Autobiography Website — System Context Diagram (Week 3)

actor "Visitor / SE Instructor\n(Evaluator)" as Visitor
actor "Site Owner / Author\n(Kalenuly Bekzat)" as Author

rectangle "Autobiography SPA\n(React + TypeScript + Vite)\n\n- Editorial Profile & Bio\n- Interactive Education Timeline\n- Light / Dark Theme Toggle\n- Bounded 'Ask About Bekzat' Q&A" as SPA #E8F8F5

database "Browser localStorage\n(Theme Preference Only;\nZero PII Stored)" as LocalStorage #F8FAFC

cloud "GitHub Platform" as GitHub #EEF2FF {
  component "Git Repository\n(Source, SPEC.md, AGENTS.md,\nPlantUML, Tests, AI_Evidence)" as Repo
  component "GitHub Actions CI/CD\n(Vitest, tsc, ESLint,\nBuild, npm audit)" as CI
  component "GitHub Pages\n(Static HTTPS Hosting)" as Pages
}

Visitor --> Pages : Opens public URL (HTTPS)
Pages --> SPA : Serves static HTML/CSS/JS bundle
Visitor --> SPA : Reads timeline, toggles theme,\nasks bounded Q&A questions
SPA <--> LocalStorage : Saves/loads theme ('light' | 'dark')

Author --> Repo : Commits biography updates,\nspec, code, tests & docs (Git)
Repo --> CI : Triggers automated verification\non push / pull_request
CI --> Pages : Deploys verified dist/ bundle\non passing main branch

note right of SPA
  Privacy & Security Boundary (W5/W12):
  - 100% static client-side execution
  - No backend DB or exposed API keys
  - Deep-frozen authoritative biography data
end note

@enduml
